WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:03.621
For someone in Mandaue looking for dental
care,

00:03.761 --> 00:08.266
a useful post may be their first encounter
with PCO Dental Clinic.

00:08.546 --> 00:11.056
Here’s how we’d make that first encounter
count.

00:14.550 --> 00:16.684
Picture someone saving a brushing tip,

00:16.824 --> 00:19.874
then recognizing the clinic’s name on a
checkup guide.

00:20.154 --> 00:23.191
When they’re ready, they can find the
clinic’s confirmed channel

00:23.331 --> 00:24.679
and ask about a visit.

00:28.550 --> 00:31.499
The campaign uses your circular PCO mark.

00:31.779 --> 00:35.193
The gradient runs from emerald through
navy to warm gray.

00:35.473 --> 00:40.008
That same identity carries across the
social posts and the website concept.

00:41.550 --> 00:42.913
Here are three examples.

00:43.193 --> 00:46.963
A fifteen-second brushing Reel puts the
two-minute timer up front.

00:47.244 --> 00:51.355
A tooth’s daily journey shows what happens
after repeated sugary sips.

00:51.635 --> 00:54.694
The checkup carousel gives readers
questions to bring.

00:57.550 --> 01:00.440
Each of the thirty posts now has its own
design.

01:00.720 --> 01:04.659
Together, they introduce the clinic and
explain everyday dental care.

01:04.939 --> 01:07.777
They also answer questions about planning
a visit.

01:08.057 --> 01:10.724
We can choose a cadence the clinic can
sustain.

01:12.550 --> 01:16.585
KRIV uses AI to help draft scripts and
test creative treatments.

01:16.865 --> 01:20.281
We edit the work and prepare it for clinic
and dentist review.

01:20.561 --> 01:23.555
With authorization, we can manage approved
posts

01:23.695 --> 01:26.830
and help connect the website to the
clinic’s inquiry process.

01:29.550 --> 01:32.825
Reach and watch time tell us which stories
hold attention.

01:33.105 --> 01:36.557
Saves and profile visits show where people
take another step.

01:36.837 --> 01:39.252
Inquiry counts and response times can show

01:39.392 --> 01:41.009
where the experience needs work.

01:44.550 --> 01:46.325
Let’s review the designs together.

01:46.605 --> 01:50.009
If the direction fits, we can choose a
small set of posts,

01:50.149 --> 01:53.105
confirm the clinic details and who will
review them,

01:53.245 --> 01:55.411
and agree what to learn from the pilot.
